      "writtenOn": "2024-02-06T02:12:24Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "This is one of the test of the GAP Test Suite Document published by the Bluetooth SIG.\n\nYou can find this document here https://www.bluetooth.org/docman/handlers/DownloadDoc.ashx?doc_id\u003d229869\n\nThis test is notably implemented by the PTS.",
      "parentUuid": "4ee4de55_baec5c45",
      "revId": "0504a76bc870eb022dd31ec81927abc002426952",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889"
    },
    {
      "unresolved": false,
      "key": {
        "uuid": "7754cf70_8e3365ba",
        "filename": "android/pandora/test/gatt_test.py",
        "patchSetId": 10
      },
      "lineNbr": 293,
      "author": {
        "id": 1964701
      },
      "writtenOn": "2024-02-06T02:16:47Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "```\n Expected Outcome\nPass verdict\nThe IUT retrieves the specified Device Name from the Lower Tester.\n```\n\nThis test seems to only verify a name can be read, not verifying the name is correct or not.",
      "parentUuid": "5afb3d10_919d5aea",
      "revId": "0504a76bc870eb022dd31ec81927abc002426952",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889"
    },
    {
      "unresolved": true,
      "key": {
        "uuid": "13c8463d_75b9534b",
        "filename": "android/pandora/test/gatt_test.py",
        "patchSetId": 10
      },
      "lineNbr": 293,
      "author": {
        "id": 1881539
      },
      "writtenOn": "2024-02-06T02:18:33Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I don\u0027t think it only verify that a name can be read 🤔\n\nMost tests from the Bluetooth Test Suite will verify that the information retrieved is valid.\n\nIn the case of the PTS, I expect it present it to the tester and ask if it\u0027s valid.",
      "parentUuid": "7754cf70_8e3365ba",
      "revId": "0504a76bc870eb022dd31ec81927abc002426952",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889"
    },
