      "writtenOn": "2024-02-06T02:25:28Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I\u0027m sorry, I unfortunately don\u0027t have anything better than this 😅\n\nThis test doesn\u0027t run with PTS-bot yet, so I don\u0027t know how the PTS implementation of it behaves.\n\nIt\u0027s just based on what I saw with other tests, like for example it seems to be the case for the test doing classic discovery https://cs.android.com/android/platform/superproject/main/+/main:packages/modules/Bluetooth/android/pandora/mmi2grpc/mmi2grpc/gap.py;l\u003d378-382;drc\u003dca935287dd8bb6457609cd7f4c02f6eedfcfbe6d\n\n(The docstring is the popup content)",
      "parentUuid": "f28f9d1b_38e357e3",
      "revId": "0504a76bc870eb022dd31ec81927abc002426952",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889"
    },
