      "writtenOn": "2024-02-06T02:48:47Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "For more context, the reason why David is asking is because if this test is already available in PTS, it would be preferable to use PTS-bot rather than implementing a dedicated Avatar test. This is a general good practice regarding Bluetooth tests as we described in https://developers.google.com/pandora/guides/testing-methodology",
      "parentUuid": "0a401b8f_48acdfb0",
      "revId": "0504a76bc870eb022dd31ec81927abc002426952",
